Andy Adamson, from the University of Michigan, will present an update on 
the Linux and BSD NFSv4 implementations including a roadmap for NFSv4 
inclusion into the Linux and BSD kernels.  Just one of the talks planned 
for the NFS Industry Conference, Sept, 22-24, 2003 at the Santa Clara 
Hilton.  Sponsored by Sun Microsystems, Network Appliance, Hummingbird 
and EMC.  See http://www.nfsconf.com for a complete agenda and full 
details.



